@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title D08 商品状态图
skinparam defaultFontName "SansSerif"
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #E8F3F1
skinparam stateBorderColor #39786C
skinparam ArrowColor #48616F
state "草稿" as Draft
state "待审核" as Pending
state "审核驳回" as Rejected
state "已发布" as Published
state "主动下架" as Offline
state "违规下架" as Blocked
[*] --> Draft : 保存商品
Draft --> Draft : 编辑并保存
Draft --> Pending : 资料有效 / 提交审核
Pending --> Rejected : 管理员驳回 / 保存原因
Rejected --> Pending : 修改后重新提交
Pending --> Published : 管理员审核通过
Published --> Published : 修改价格、邮费、可售库存
Published --> Pending : 修改标题、图片、描述、类型或分类
Published --> Offline : 卖家主动下架
Offline --> Pending : 卖家申请再次上架
Published --> Blocked : 管理员执行违规下架
Blocked --> Blocked : 卖家提交整改 / 管理员反馈
Blocked --> Pending : 管理员批准整改复核
note right of Published
  在售 = 已发布且可售库存 > 0
  售罄 = 已发布且可售库存 = 0
  下单、取消和关闭改变库存数量。
end note
note bottom of Offline
  库存释放保留当前审核及上下架状态。
  已有订单依据快照继续履约。
end note
legend bottom
  REQ-002、003、004、008、010、018、025
endlegend
@enduml
